# Proof Spec

Proof defines how an Entity proves what it did.

```json
{
  "proof_id": "proof_001",
  "entity_id": "skill_001",
  "node_id": "node_001",
  "proof_type": "skill_invocation_result",
  "task_id": "task_001",
  "invocation_id": "invoke_001",
  "input_hash": "sha256:input",
  "output_hash": "sha256:output",
  "evidence_ref": "ipfs://bafy...",
  "signature": "sig_xxx"
}
```
